{"2719680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "5 Bucks for the Bus", "steam_appid": 2719680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a hard day's work you've decided to buy yourself a little treat . . . wait, did you make sure to save some cash for the bus ride home? Uh oh, that's not good.<br>Now you're lost in The City as it slowly starts to turn weird. Things that you were never meant to see start slipping through the cracks, and now this internet café's owner has recruited you to find her some customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to scrape together 5 bucks for the bus?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to save the people you befriend?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to keep on living in the end?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A network of first-person dungeons to crawl through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles where you play cards against your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sentient cheese burgers that you can both eat and defeat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d8256e391ca042f6f07990ca5f517ed7.poster.avif?t=1778342586\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d8256e391ca042f6f07990ca5f517ed7.webm?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d8256e391ca042f6f07990ca5f517ed7.mp4?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The City is a big place that opens up more and more as you explore it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like a real city there's lots to do and a lotta wacko characters to meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d684f15602efce502d8e1b44dbe16c67.poster.avif?t=1778342586\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d684f15602efce502d8e1b44dbe16c67.webm?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/d684f15602efce502d8e1b44dbe16c67.mp4?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>To get around you'll have to enter all kinds of dungeons.</strong><br>Yes cities have dungeons! Haven't you ever wondered what's behind &quot;DO NOT ENTER&quot; signs??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/0dc8f7bbe04866aa55034c3e970e9aa1.poster.avif?t=1778342586\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/0dc8f7bbe04866aa55034c3e970e9aa1.webm?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719680/extras/0dc8f7bbe04866aa55034c3e970e9aa1.mp4?t=1778342586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>In dungeons you meet different foes who you'll have to fight of with playing cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A funky 